    (cl-comment "Summary of Alethetic Complexity Integration Formalism (ACIF)")
    
    (cl-comment "KEY COMPONENTS:")
    (cl-comment "- Unified proposition space (PropSpace) hosting Catuskoti phases + Dfix0")
    (cl-comment "- LUMO formalization: (σ, ℓ) as observer state and temporal axis")
