    (cl-comment "- Local completeness: decidability within each observer level")
    (cl-comment "- Gödel resolution: undecidability overcome by dimensional ascent")
    (cl-comment "- Observer-side decoherence: indeterminate → determinate transition")
    (cl-comment "- AC/KC complementarity: KC minimization drives AC minimization → Dfix0")
    (cl-comment "- LLM as inductive truth calculator: Solomonoff induction as Bestimize")
    
    (cl-comment "KEY THEOREMS:")
    (cl-comment "1. LocalCompletenessAtEachLevel (Section 10)")
    (cl-comment "   Each observer level has complete decidability for observable propositions")
    
    (cl-comment "2. GoedelSentenceResolution (Section 11)")
    (cl-comment "   Gödel sentences become decidable at higher dimensional levels")
    
    (cl-comment "3. IncompletenessSubyataIsomorphism (Section 12)")
    (cl-comment "   Gödel's incompleteness isomorphic to Buddhist Sunyata structure")
    
    (cl-comment "4. LLM_InductiveTruthRealization (Section 13)")
    (cl-comment "   LLM operationally realizes Solomonoff induction as Bestimize")
    
    (cl-comment "UNIFIED HIERARCHY:")
    (cl-comment "SunyataCategory (root self-reference)")
    (cl-comment "  ↓ [rupture of self-reference]")
    (cl-comment "Aletheia (hiddenness-revealing)")
    (cl-comment "  ↓ [dual-axis generation]")
    (cl-comment "SKDT (space-time axis pairs)")
    (cl-comment "  ↓ [progressive manifestation]")
